This product includes software adapted from third-party projects. The
Transformer building blocks (attention, MLP, Transformer block, 3-D patch
embedding, stochastic depth, truncated-normal initialisation) and the
sinusoidal positional-encoding helpers follow the masked-autoencoder
implementation of VideoMAE, which itself builds on BEiT and on the
pytorch-image-models (timm) library. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the
corresponding license texts and attribution.
